(362, 4, 'What time does Linda usually wake up?', 'Text: Linda’s Life\n\nLinda is a high school student. She lives in the city with her parents and younger brother. Every morning, she wakes up at 6 o’clock. She brushes her teeth, washes her face, and gets dressed for school. Then, she has breakfast with her family. Her favorite breakfast is bread with eggs and fruit. After breakfast, Linda goes to school. She likes English and math classes the most. During breaks, she talks with her friends and sometimes helps them with homework. After school, she comes back home and studies English for one hour. If she has free time, she likes to play badminton or read a book. On weekends, Linda visits her grandmother in the countryside. She enjoys helping her grandmother in the garden and feeding the chickens. She also likes to cook simple dishes with her grandmother. Sometimes, Linda rides her bicycle around the village and takes photos of flowers and trees. Linda dreams of becoming an English teacher in the future. She knows she has to study hard and practice English every day. Her family supports her a lot, and they are proud of her.', 0, 1, '2026-09-30 08:09:36', '2026-09-30 08:09:36'),
